# Auth flow. Run with the "https" launch profile: the refresh cookie is Secure (__Secure- prefix),
# so it is only sent back over HTTPS.

@host = https://localhost:7215
@email = alice@example.com
@password = correct-horse-battery

### Register → 202 both for a new account and for an email that is already taken
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### Register with a weak password → 400 with the password rules
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "short"
}
